      "description": "This endpoint uses **Basic Authentication** to retrieve an access token, which must be included in the header of all subsequent API requests for secure interaction with the Valifi Platform.\n\n#### Key Details:\n\n- **Authentication Method**: Basic Authentication using a username and password.\n    \n- **Token Expiry**: Tokens are time-limited and should be refreshed as needed.\n    \n- **Production Environment Requirements**:\n    \n    - **Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)**: Real users are required to complete 2FA by entering a verification code sent via SMS.\n        \n    - **IP Whitelisting**: API users must ensure their server's IP addresses are added to the whitelist for added security.\n        \n\nEnsure that tokens are stored securely and never shared or exposed publicly. Always follow best practices for secure authentication when integrating with the API."
    },
